; Issue #5437: a variadic define called with a closure argument binds its
; rest parameter as a list on every pipeline. On the IR faces (force-soa,
; the REPL) the define bridge bound the rest symbol by position: (f g 1 2 3)
; answered 1 and (h g 1 2 3) answered (1 2), with no arity check.
(define (f g . xs) (g xs))
(define (h g a . xs) (g a xs))
(display (f list 1 2 3)) (newline)
(display (f (lambda (x) x) 1 2 3)) (newline)
(display (h list 1 2 3)) (newline)
(display (h (lambda (a xs) (list a xs)) 1 2 3)) (newline)
(display (f (lambda (x) (null? x)))) (newline)
